{"seq":1,"slug":"loot-tables-drop-rates","title":"掉落表与概率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/loot-generation/loot-tables-drop-rates","wordCount":1362,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"掉落表与概率\">掉落表与概率</h1><p>「打死这个 boss 能掉什么」这句玩家最关心的问题，在代码里的答案是一张掉落表（loot table）。它是一组带权重的条目，外加可能的嵌套、保证掉落与条件掉落规则。掉落表是整个 <a href=\"procedural-itemization\">掉落生成</a> 章节的骨架——先决定掉哪个模板，再由后续篇章决定这件物品 roll 出什么词缀、有没有保底。本篇把加权随机抽样这台核心引擎讲透。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>掉落表的本质是一次加权随机抽样：从一组条目中按各自权重抽取。权重不必是概率（不必和为 1），引擎在抽样时归一化即可。这种「权重而非概率」的设计让策划增删条目时无需手动重算其余项的概率，极大降低了维护成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[击杀触发掉落] --&gt; B[加载该敌人的 LootTable]&#10;  B --&gt; C{保证掉落条目?}&#10;  C --&gt;|有| D[必出·如固定金币]&#10;  C --&gt; E[加权随机抽 1~N 个条目]&#10;  E --&gt; F{条目是子表?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是·嵌套| G[递归进入子表抽取]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H[生成该物品实例]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[交给词缀/品质生成]\">flowchart TD\n  A[击杀触发掉落] --&gt; B[加载该敌人的 LootTable]\n  B --&gt; C{保证掉落条目?}\n  C --&gt;|有| D[必出·如固定金币]\n  C --&gt; E[加权随机抽 1~N 个条目]\n  E --&gt; F{条目是子表?}\n  F --&gt;|是·嵌套| G[递归进入子表抽取]\n  F --&gt;|否| H[生成该物品实例]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[交给词缀/品质生成]</pre><p>一张成熟的掉落表包含三类条目：保证掉落（必出，如击杀必给经验金币）、加权随机（按权重抽，决定稀有装备）、条件掉落（满足某条件才进池，如首杀奖励、特定难度专属）。三者组合出「稳定底盘 + 随机惊喜 + 条件彩蛋」的产出节奏。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条目类型</th>\n<th>触发规则</th>\n<th>是否计权重</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保证掉落</td>\n<td>必出</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>经验、基础金币、任务物品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权随机</td>\n<td>按权重抽样</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>装备、材料、稀有物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件掉落</td>\n<td>满足前置条件才入池</td>\n<td>是（入池后）</td>\n<td>首杀、难度专属、活动限定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套子表</td>\n<td>抽中后递归</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>复用「武器池」「材料池」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"加权随机抽样-算法与实现\">加权随机抽样：算法与实现</h2><p>加权抽样的标准算法是：算出所有条目权重之和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 取一个随机数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，然后顺序累加权重，落入哪个区间就抽中哪个条目。某条目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 被抽中的概率即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = w_i / S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public LootEntry Roll(List&lt;LootEntry&gt; entries, Random rng) {&#10;    int total = entries.Sum(e =&gt; e.Weight);&#10;    int r = rng.Next(total);          // [0, total)&#10;    int acc = 0;&#10;    foreach (var e in entries) {&#10;        acc += e.Weight;&#10;        if (r &lt; acc) return e;        // 落入 [acc-w, acc) 区间&#10;    }&#10;    return entries[^1];               // 浮点/边界兜底&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public LootEntry Roll(List&#x3C;LootEntry> entries, Random rng) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int total = entries.Sum(e => e.Weight);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int r = rng.Next(total);          // [0, total)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    int acc = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    foreach (var e in entries) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        acc += e.Weight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (r &#x3C; acc) return e;        // 落入 [acc-w, acc) 区间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return entries[^1];               // 浮点/边界兜底</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段线性扫描是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，对几十条目的掉落表绰绰有余。当一张表有成千上万条目且被高频抽取（如全服掉落计算）时，可改用别名法（Walker&#39;s Alias Method）把单次抽样降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，代价是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 预处理。加权抽样的数学基础——离散分布、期望——与 <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/foundations/probability-random\">游戏经济与平衡的概率与随机</a> 一脉相承，建议对照阅读。</p>\n<p>权重设计有个实用技巧：用「万分比」或大整数权重而非小数概率，既避免浮点误差，又方便表达极低概率（传说装备权重 1、普通装备权重 9999）。这套权重最终决定的是抽中哪个 <a href=\"../foundations/item-data-model\">物品模板</a>，而非物品的最终品质。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌套掉落表与抽取数量\">嵌套掉落表与抽取数量</h2><p>真实游戏的掉落表是树状的。一个 boss 的顶层表可能是「抽 1 次主表」，主表里某个条目指向「稀有武器子表」，子表再细分到具体武器。嵌套带来两大好处：复用（多个 boss 共享同一个「通用材料池」）与分层概率（先决定大类，再决定具体物品）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Boss 顶层表] --&gt; B[抽 3 次]&#10;  B --&gt; C[60% 材料子表]&#10;  B --&gt; D[35% 装备子表]&#10;  B --&gt; E[5% 稀有子表]&#10;  C --&gt; F[各类材料按权重]&#10;  D --&gt; G[各类装备按权重]&#10;  E --&gt; H[传说/独特物品]\">graph TD\n  A[Boss 顶层表] --&gt; B[抽 3 次]\n  B --&gt; C[60% 材料子表]\n  B --&gt; D[35% 装备子表]\n  B --&gt; E[5% 稀有子表]\n  C --&gt; F[各类材料按权重]\n  D --&gt; G[各类装备按权重]\n  E --&gt; H[传说/独特物品]</pre><p>抽取数量（drop count）是另一维设计：一次击杀掉几件？固定数量、范围随机（掉 2~5 件）、或对每个条目独立判定（每件物品各自掷一次「是否掉落」）。独立判定常用于「每件装备 X% 概率掉落」的设计，与加权抽「掉哪一件」是两种不同的概率模型，需想清你要哪种。嵌套与数量共同塑造了产出的丰俭节奏，而每件抽中物品接下来的品质与词缀，交给 <a href=\"procedural-itemization\">程序化词缀与品质</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"magic-find-与动态权重\">Magic Find 与动态权重</h2><p>许多刷子游戏允许玩家通过装备词缀或药水临时改变掉落概率——即「魔法寻找」（Magic Find / 掉宝率）。实现上是在抽样前对稀有条目的权重做动态放大：稀有度越高的条目，受 MF 加成越强，从而提高（但不保证）出货。这要求掉落表的权重不是写死的常量，而是抽样时即时计算的函数。</p>\n<p>动态权重还服务于 LiveOps：限时活动期间提升某物品权重、双倍掉落周末、按玩家进度调整难度专属池。这把静态掉落表变成了一个可被运营实时调控的旋钮，其商业与留存考量延伸到 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/liveops/liveops-events\">商业化与 LiveOps</a>。但动态权重必须服务器权威计算，否则就是改掉宝率的外挂温床，详见 <a href=\"../practice/networking-persistence\">网络同步与持久化</a>。需要警惕的是，纯加权随机会产生残酷的长连续不出货体感，对此的护栏机制由 <a href=\"pity-systems-pseudo-random\">保底与伪随机分布</a> 专门解决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>掉落表是带权重的条目集合，权重无需归一化，引擎抽样时归一化，方便策划增删条目。</li>\n<li>三类条目：保证掉落（必出）、加权随机（按权重）、条件掉落（满足前置才入池）。</li>\n<li>加权抽样标准算法是前缀和扫描 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i = w_i / S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>；超大表用别名法降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>嵌套子表带来复用与分层概率；抽取数量有固定/范围/每件独立判定三种模型。</li>\n<li>Magic Find 用动态权重放大稀有条目，必须服务器权威，是 LiveOps 的调控旋钮。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>抽中物品的品质与词缀见 <a href=\"procedural-itemization\">程序化词缀与品质</a>；长连续不出货的护栏见 <a href=\"pity-systems-pseudo-random\">保底与伪随机分布</a>；物品模板见 <a href=\"../foundations/item-data-model\">物品数据模型</a>。</li>\n<li>动态权重的服务器权威见 <a href=\"../practice/networking-persistence\">网络同步与持久化</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：概率数学基础见 <a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/foundations/probability-random\">游戏经济与平衡</a>；活动掉落见 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/liveops/liveops-events\">商业化与 LiveOps</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"掉落表与概率","id":"掉落表与概率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"加权随机抽样：算法与实现","id":"加权随机抽样-算法与实现"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套掉落表与抽取数量","id":"嵌套掉落表与抽取数量"},{"level":2,"text":"Magic Find 与动态权重","id":"magic-find-与动态权重"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"负重与容量约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/inventory-systems/weight-encumbrance"},"next":{"title":"程序化词缀与品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/loot-generation/procedural-itemization"}}